  "details": "Problem:\n\nOccasionally people come into worlds to take photos of everyone's avatar without asking.  Many feel uncomfortable when this happens. \n\nRequest:\n\nAdd a privacy option to prevent non-friends of taking photos of your avatar.\n\nIdeas on how to address it:\n\n- Not rendering the avatar within the camera\n\n- Putting a blurring/pixelizing filter over the avatar",
